  "job_B3.4.7_20251003_114749": {
    "text": "Her s\u00e6g\u00f0 hu sanctus Isodorus spr\u00e6c be \u00f0\u00e6re sawle gedale & be \u00fe\u00e6s lichoman.\nHe cw\u00e6\u00f0: Min sawl on nearunesse is geseted & min gast me hata\u00f0 & min heorte is gedrefedu & mines\nEallum yflum ic eom seald, cw\u00e6\u00f0 seo synfulle sawl, & eallre unges\u00e6lignesse ic eom bewrigen.\nNe mette ic n\u00e6fre on minum life swa mycles sares ne yfeles gem\u00e6ccan swa ic me nu \u00e6tforan geseo.\nFor \u00f0an \u00fee swa hwyder swa ic fare, min unges\u00e6lignesse me f\u00e6r\u00f0 mid, & min yfel ic nahw\u00e6r befleon ne\nSwa hwyder swa ic me hwyrfe, hie me samod si\u00f0ia\u00f0.\nEala \u00fe\u00e6t ic w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6s heardestan ge\u00feohtes mann & \u00fe\u00e6s forcu\u00f0estan, \u00fe\u00e6t ic me mine dagas to nytte ne\nAc \u00f0a \u00fee ic hira willan worhte, hie willa\u00f0 me nu gesce\u00f0\u00f0an.\nHie senda\u00f0 hira handa on me, \u00fe\u00e6t hie me mid sare ut ateon & to frecnessum utgel\u00e6den.\nN\u00e6nig minum yflum me gefultuma\u00f0, \u00fea ic sylfa \u00e6r ne wolde, ac eallum ic eom l\u00e6\u00f0ed & ealle hie me\nWa la, cw\u00e6\u00f0 sio synfulle sawl, hwam sceal ic gelyfan \u00e6fter me, o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00e6t hwam sceal ic getreow\u00f0a\nN\u00e6nig min \u00fe\u00e6ra nehstena getreowne geleafan hafa\u00fe.\nEawla, se geleafa is geworden & he is numen & he n\u00e6s naworn gesund.\nOngita\u00fe, mine \u00fea leofestan bearn, cw\u00e6\u00f0 sanctus Isodorus, & \u00e6ghwylc cristen mann smeage on him\nFor \u00fean ne sceal n\u00e6fre se cristena man beon orsorhleas.\nCw\u00e6\u00f0 sanctus Ysodorus, ge\u00feence nu \u00f0u, man, & ongyt gif \u00f0u sylf \u00fee nelt alysan \u00fea hwile \u00fee \u00f0u miht.\nHwi wenst \u00f0u \u00fe\u00e6t o\u00f0res gastes hordf\u00e6t \u00fee wile alysan gif \u00f0u sylf nelt?\nEawla, cw\u00e6\u00f0 se halga Isodorus, hw\u00e6t, \u00fe\u00e6t is yfelic \u00feeaw & synlic, \u00fe\u00e6t n\u00e6nig \u00feam syngendum\n\u00dea godan w\u00e6dlia\u00fe on \u00feysse worulde & \u00fea manfullan gehyhta\u00fe.\n\u00dea manfullan wealda\u00fe nu on heora rice & hyna\u00f0 \u00fea godan.\n\u00d0a unrihtan synt geweor\u00f0ode nu & \u00fea so\u00f0f\u00e6stan aweorpene.\n\u00dea unrihtan blissia\u00f0 & \u00fea so\u00f0f\u00e6stan synt on gnornunge & on heafe.\n& se arleasa g\u00e6\u00f0 nu beforan \u00feam so\u00f0f\u00e6stan & se yfla wylt \u00feam so\u00f0f\u00e6stan & \u00feam godum, & \u00fea\nFor \u00feyllicum synnum & o\u00f0rum beo\u00f0 \u00fea sawla witnode on Godes gesyh\u00f0e, & hio nat, \u00feonne heo synfull\nAc hio swiga\u00f0, for \u00fean \u00fee heo nafa\u00fe nane bylde on hire.\nSe halga Isodorus cw\u00e6\u00f0: Eawla \u00fe\u00e6t sio sawl hiofe\u00f0 \u00feonne hio of \u00f0am lichoman anumen bi\u00f0.\nEalle hie hie swa wundige hyrwa\u00f0, & swa fule stincende hie hie onscunia\u00f0, & swa hreofe hie hie\nAc \u00fea cwelleras unoflinnedlice cwelma\u00f0, & hie unaseccgendlice gnornunge hire wite m\u00e6na\u00f0, for \u00fean\n& \u00feusendfealdum witum hie hie tintregia\u00f0 & slita\u00f0, & se lichoma on eor\u00f0an fulnessum toflowe\u00f0 \u00fee we\nEawla, cw\u00e6\u00f0 se halga Ysodorus, \u00feonne gyt geomra\u00f0 seo sawl \u00fee hire lif \u00e6r on receleaste lifde, & cwi\u00f0:\nWa la \u00fe\u00e6t ic swa lange on minum lichaman eardigan sceolde, \u00fea he me reste geearnigan ne wolde.\nUnlust me w\u00e6s to lifianne, & walic to sweltanne.\nEawla, dea\u00f0, swete eart \u00f0u \u00feam earmum & \u00feam w\u00e6dliendum, & wunsum eart \u00f0u \u00feam unrotum & \u00feam\n\u00dee se dea\u00f0 \u00e6lces yfeles & eges ende is.\nSelre bi\u00f0 men \u00fe\u00e6t he swelte \u00feonne he yfele lybbe mid synnum & on Godes unwillan sy &\nFor \u00f0an ungeendedu is min gnornung, & mine wita ne synt gelihte, ne min sar ende n\u00e6f\u00f0.\nNis me n\u00e6nig leoht ne n\u00e6nigo byldo on minum mode, for \u00f0an \u00feas witu ic \u00e6rest aberan ne m\u00e6g.\n\u00d0a deoflu hire \u00feonne andsweria\u00f0 & cwe\u00f0a\u00f0: N\u00e6fst \u00f0u hiht ne byldu on \u00fee eallra \u00feara goda \u00fee \u00f0e God\nHwig \u00feinca\u00f0 \u00fee \u00feas witu \u00fey maran \u00fee \u00f0e \u00e6r \u00fea gewyrhtu \u00feuhton?\nOngita\u00f0, mine \u00fea leofestan, cw\u00e6\u00f0 se halga Isodorus, hu mycel nearones \u00fe\u00e6re sawle bi\u00f0 \u00feonne heo hit\nFor \u00f0an ne l\u00e6ta\u00f0 eow, men \u00fea leofestan, \u00feysse worulde welan beswican, for \u00f0an heo is sceort & swicol\nEalle \u00feas l\u00e6nendlican earfe\u00f0nessa ende habba\u00f0, ac \u00f0a toweardan ende nabba\u00fe.\nNe n\u00e6niges mannes lif ne bi\u00f0 to \u00fean lange \u00fe\u00e6t on sceortre & on sarigre hwile ne geendige.\nFor \u00f0an sare & eallum \u00f0am unrotnessum on \u00feysse worulde we beo\u00f0 gen\u00e6tte.\nN\u00e6nig ne sie se \u00f0e ne sarige his synna, & wepan he sceal & hreowsian \u00fe\u00e6t he ne scyle on ecnesse\nUs gedafna\u00f0 \u00feurh manigfealde earfe\u00f0nessa to ganganne on heofena rice.\nLytle synt \u00feas l\u00e6nendlican earfo\u00f0nessa \u00fey we nu ar\u00e6fnan magon for \u00fe\u00e6s lufan, & mycle synt \u00fea meda\nSwa mycle swi\u00f0or swa we nu beo\u00f0 n\u00e6tte on \u00feyssum life, swa mycle ma we feoga\u00f0 on \u00f0am toweardan\nFor \u00f0an symle God her wunda\u00f0 & swing\u00f0 \u00f0a \u00fee he wile habban & to \u00feam ecan life gel\u00e6dan.\nSwa swa gold on ofne he hie sy\u00f0 & costa\u00f0, & swa ons\u00e6gdnesse he hie onfeh\u00f0.\nFor \u00f0an ne sceal nan man gnornigan on his untrumnesse, ne cwe\u00f0an: For hwan ar\u00e6fne ic \u00f0as yfel o\u00f0\u00f0e\nWa la, to hwan \u00ferowige ic \u00feis?\nAc ma \u00f0u scealt cwe\u00f0an: Dryhten, \u00fee ic syngode, swa mycel ic ne gefele swa ic wyr\u00f0e eom.\nSe \u00f0e gnorna\u00f0 on his untrumnesse, God he tyrg\u00f0 & his yrre he awec\u00f0.\n& se \u00f0e hit ge\u00feyldlice abere\u00f0, God li\u00f0e he awaca\u00f0 to him.\nGe\u00feenc nu \u00f0u, man, \u00feonne \u00f0u sie cwylmed on \u00feyssum middangearde on \u00feinum untrymnesse, beheald\n\u00deonne \u00feu gefele \u00fe\u00e6t sar, gemyne \u00fe\u00e6t cwicsusles fyr.\nGif \u00f0u \u00fee ondr\u00e6dest \u00fea toweardan witu, \u00feonne ne sargast \u00f0u na \u00fe\u00e6s l\u00e6nendlican.\n\u00de\u00e6t bi\u00f0 twyfeald yfel, \u00fe\u00e6t man sarige his lichamlican earfo\u00f0nessa, for \u00f0an he hie sceal \u00ferowian swa\nWite \u00f0u, man, butan Godes willan \u00fee on becyme\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t yrre, ac \u00f0onne he yrre geworden bi\u00f0 & for urum\n\u00de\u00e6s lichoman lustum we oftost fulganga\u00f0, for \u00f0an he sceal bion hwilum swungen.\nSe lichoma oftost gesynga\u00f0, & for \u00f0an he sceal beon geuntrumod & witnod.\nGif we woldon gesceawian us sylfe on ure heortan hwylce we w\u00e6ron & us \u00feonne deman be urum\nAc we unges\u00e6lige byrna\u00f0 on \u00feysse worulde lufan & on hire gitsunge, & l\u00e6ta\u00f0 us colian \u00fea lufe \u00fe\u00e6s\nCw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t se halga Ysodorus, Hu lange willa\u00f0 ge cristenan recelease wunigan on \u00fe\u00e6re fulnesse \u00fe\u00e6s\nOflinna\u00f0 la, \u00e6r eow se dea\u00f0 ofercume.\nAc eow \u00feince\u00f0 swi\u00f0e earfo\u00f0lice \u00fea unge\u00few\u00e6ran \u00feeawas & \u00fea gescyndan to forl\u00e6tanne, for \u00f0an \u00fey \u00f0\u00e6t\nAc wi\u00f0standa\u00f0 him nu \u00fea hwile \u00fee ge magon & moton, & setta\u00f0 togeanes eowres lichoman lustum &\nWe witon hw\u00e6t we on \u00feyssum d\u00e6ge wyrcende w\u00e6ron, ac we nyton on \u00feysse nihte \u00feeah hio sie ut\n& us \u00feonne \u00f0\u00e6t deoful l\u00e6de on his witu \u00fee us \u00e6r on life mid \u00fe\u00e6re synbryne on\u00e6l\u00fe.\nMid unasecgendlican tintrego he us cwylme\u00f0, se \u00f0e we \u00e6r his willan worhton on worulde.\nFor \u00f0an us let God on \u00feyssum life \u00fe\u00e6t o\u00f0era manna for\u00f0for sceolde bion ure gelicnesse.\nEawla, sawl, \u00f0u \u00f0e eardodest on \u00feines lichoman tintregum, waca & gebide \u00feinne dryhten, \u00fee l\u00e6s \u00fee\nGehyra\u00f0, men \u00fea leofestan, \u00f0a \u00f0e her syndon on \u00feyssum folce dysige & recelease.\nGanga\u00f0 to deadra manna bebyrigenesse & geseo\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6r lifigendra bysene.\nIo hie w\u00e6ron us gelice on \u00feysse worulde wynsumnesse lifigende & him welena stryndon & him mycla\nAc \u00f0as ealle synt fram him anumen.\n\u00dey hine ne scele nan man swa sylfne beswican \u00fe\u00e6t he him langes lifes wene.\nAc \u00f0u, man, cw\u00e6\u00f0 se halga Ysodorus, ic \u00f0e bidde & halsige & geornlice ic \u00fee manige \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u nanwiht\nAc \u00f0u, ma, bewite \u00fee sylfne & wite hw\u00e6t \u00f0u eart & for hwan \u00f0u sie & hw\u00e6t \u00f0u sie & for hwan \u00feu\nGemyne \u00feinne scippend & gemyne \u00f0\u00e6t \u00f0u geworht eart & ongyt hwylcne \u00fee God gesceop & gemyne\nHe \u00f0e bebead \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u healde \u00feinne rihtan geleafan & \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u h\u00e6bbe bylwitne geleafan, & wunige on \u00fee\nN\u00e6nig \u00fee mid unsnotre lare \u00f0e beswice ne n\u00e6nig ge\u00fewornesse \u00feysse worulde \u00f0e ateo fram Godes\nNe n\u00e6nig \u00feing \u00feristlice be Criste \u00f0u sprec, ne n\u00e6nig wiht \u00f0weorlices be him \u00f0u gehyr sprecan.\nAc \u00f0onne \u00f0u hine cigst on \u00feinum wordum, ne wi\u00f0sac \u00f0u hine on \u00feinum weorcum, & fram eallum \u00feam\n& nanwiht wi\u00f0 Godes bebodu \u00f0u do, ac leofa on gode & gebide \u00fee to him, for \u00f0an \u00fee \u00f0urh yfelra\nNe syle \u00f0u \u00feine sawle on \u00feines lichaman geweald, ac gecl\u00e6nsa \u00f0u \u00fein mod fram yfelum ge\u00feohtum &\nFor \u00f0an we witon \u00fe\u00e6t be urum ge\u00feohtum we sceolon beon demede fram Gode, nales \u00fe\u00e6t an \u00fe\u00e6t he\nGod se is dema; be urum ge\u00feohtum he m\u00e6n\u00f0 ure sawle.\nFor \u00f0an \u00feonne hie us cuma\u00f0, utan him wi\u00f0standan & of ure heortan aweorpan \u00f0a yflan ge\u00feohtas.\nFor \u00fean ne m\u00e6g se lichama nanwiht don butan hit \u00fe\u00e6t mod wille.\nUtan cl\u00e6nsian ure ge\u00f0ohtas, \u00feonne ure lichoma ne synga\u00f0.\nGehyr \u00f0u, mann, cw\u00e6\u00f0 se halga Ysodorus, & hlyst to \u00fean \u00fee ic \u00fee l\u00e6re & ongyt \u00fea \u00f0e ic \u00fee to manige:\nSelre bi\u00f0 men \u00fe\u00e6t he swelte \u00feonne he his lichoman fyrwetgyrnessum gewenige; selre w\u00e6re \u00f0\u00e6re\nSio forh\u00e6fdnesse gede\u00f0 Gode \u00feone mannan neal\u00e6can.\n\u00de\u00e6r sio forh\u00e6fdnesse wuna\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6r wuna\u00f0 God, & sio cl\u00e6nnes us geh\u00e6t heofona rice.\nSio fyrwetgyrnes besenc\u00f0 \u00feone mannan on helle & sio fyrwetgyrnesse syle\u00f0 \u00feone mannan \u00feam\nEala \u00f0u, man, gif \u00f0e nu gyt \u00feines lichoman une\u00f0nessa hrinen o\u00f0\u00fee hie \u00f0e cynsende fyrwetgyrnesse\n& for \u00fean sie \u00f0e swa mycel geornfulnes \u00fea synna to betanne swa \u00f0e w\u00e6s \u00e6r hie to wyrcanne.\nN\u00e6nig \u00feing on \u00feysse worulde \u00fee gedo \u00feinra synna sorhleasne, ac \u00f0urhwunige on \u00feinre heortan ege &\n\u00deurh \u00feone ege \u00f0u gebetest \u00fea synne.\n\u00de\u00e6r lufu ne bi\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6r bi\u00f0 ealles lifes tolysnesse.\nEala, hu unasecgendlica synt \u00feysses lifes idelnessa & forwyrda.\nFor \u00fean \u00feeah \u00fee we hie forl\u00e6ten, we ne sculon ure heortan eft to him hweorfan, for \u00feam \u00fee \u00f0a welan\nGod \u00feone mannan to his anlicnesse geworhte, & \u00feonne hw\u00e6\u00f0ere idellice he swinc\u00f0 & on gewinne he\nHe goldhord samna\u00f0, ac he ne wat hwam he hit samna\u00f0.\nFor \u00f0am \u00fee we ealle nacode & forl\u00e6tene arisa\u00f0 swa swa we geborene w\u00e6ron, & to \u00feam andrysenlican\nBeforan heahsetle \u00fe\u00e6s ecan deman we beo\u00f0 al\u00e6dde \u00f0onne we bio\u00f0 aworpene of \u00feysses rices welan &\n& we ne bio\u00f0 gedyrstige for urum synnum urne wealdend gesion.\nAc \u00f0a \u00f0e nu to swi\u00f0e ne blissia\u00f0 on \u00feysse leasan worulde welum, hie feo\u00f0 \u00feonne on \u00feam toweardan\n\u00d0a \u00f0e nu be sylfwille Gode \u00feeowia\u00f0, hie gefeo\u00f0 \u00feonne on \u00feam heofonlican brydbure, & \u00f0a \u00f0e nu\nAc \u00f0a earman & \u00fea synfullan to fyres tintregum hie beo\u00f0 getogene.\nWe grania\u00f0 \u00feonne, & ne bi\u00f0 se \u00f0e ure gemiltsie.\nWe geomria\u00f0 \u00feonne, & ne bi\u00f0 se \u00f0e us hal gedo.\nAc utan efestan, \u00fea hwile \u00fee we tide h\u00e6bben, to hebbanne ure handa to dryhtne, & cwe\u00f0an \u00fe\u00e6t us\nLa, hu lange we urne wealdend & urne scyppend to hatheortnesse getihten.\n\u00c6lce d\u00e6ge he us gearwa\u00f0 & we his bio\u00f0 ungemyndige.\n\u00c6lce d\u00e6ge he us fede\u00f0 & \u00e6lce d\u00e6ge he us miltsa\u00f0, & we hira bio\u00f0 forgitende.\nHe us fet & he us scylt & ealle ussa nyd\u00feearfa he gesieh\u00f0, & \u00feeah \u00e6lce d\u00e6ge his bebodu we hyrwa\u00f0.\nLa, hwi ne sceama\u00f0 us?\nUtan sceamian ure \u00e6r \u00fean \u00fee sio tid cume \u00f0e us neal\u00e6ce\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t we sceolon ures lifes & eallra ura d\u00e6da\n& for \u00f0an uton oflinnan \u00feara unarimedra metta & \u00feara gescyndendra gestreona & \u00feara oftr\u00e6dra symla\nUtan eac oflinnan \u00feara t\u00e6lnessa, & uton us on gebedu geloml\u00e6can, & uton ure lif on rihtre gewendan,\nIc bidde & halsige \u00e6ghwylcne cristene mann \u00fe\u00e6t we l\u00e6tan \u00f0as lare on ure heortan f\u00e6ste wunian.\n& uton ne l\u00e6tan hie diofol \u00feurh his searwa us fram animan.\nAc utan sorgian on \u00f0ysse medmyclan tide \u00fe\u00e6t we ne \u00feyrfen wepan in ecnesse \u00feone biterestan wop.\n& utan winnan on \u00feyssum l\u00e6nan life \u00fee l\u00e6s we \u00ferowien eft \u00fea ecan tintrego.\n\u00deeos tid is sceort & sio is mycel & ungeendod.\nFor \u00f0an \u00fe\u00e6t is se wyrresta d\u00e6g se n\u00e6nigne onlyst.\n\u00de\u00e6r bi\u00f0 soht fram anra gehwylcum hw\u00e6t he yfeles gedyde o\u00f0\u00fee godes.\nWa \u00f0am \u00feonne \u00fee nu bi\u00f0 w\u00e6lhreow, for \u00f0an he bi\u00f0 cwylmed on ecnesse.\nWa \u00f0am \u00fee nele nu his synna hreowe don, for \u00fean he bi\u00f0 seald \u00feonne \u00f0am re\u00f0estan feondum \u00fea hine\nNe sceolon we to swi\u00f0e arian ussum fl\u00e6sce \u00fey l\u00e6s hit eft in forwyrd forl\u00e6de.\nSe lichoma l\u00e6men is, for \u00f0am \u00fee he of \u00f0am geworht w\u00e6s & he eft to duste geweor\u00f0an sceal.\nAc uton we, men \u00f0a leofestan, cw\u00e6\u00f0 se halga Ysodorus, ea\u00f0modlice biddan God \u00fe\u00e6t he us gehealde",
